{
  "_comment": "Golden vectors for the Zheng Shangyou 'why can't I play this' classification. Two implementations read this file: internal/domain/ZhengEval_test.go (ZhengInvalidReason) and frontend/src/utils/zhengComboValidator.golden.test.ts (zhengInvalidReason). Cards are {suit,value} with suit 0 = JOKER (value 1 = small, 2 = big), 1=Spade 2=Clover 3=Heart 4=Diamond. tablePlayType uses the ZhengPlayType constants: 0 invalid, 1 single, 2 pair, 3 triple, 4 straight, 5 pairRun, 6 bomb, 7 jokerBomb. reason is \"\" when the play is legal.",
